{% doc %}
  USP (Unique Selling Points) Grid Section - Displays promotional items with icons, titles, and subtitles.

  Features:
  - Supports up to 4 configurable blocks with icon and supporting copy
  - Responsive behavior:
    * Mobile (< 768px): 2x2 grid layout
    * Desktop (≥ 768px): 4x1 grid layout

